  <iati-identifier>XM-DAC-7-PPR-4000006878</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-7" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the Netherlands</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Workshop Series on Non-Discrimination of the LGBTIQ Community for Political Activists</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to raise awareness and get support from the political parties to decriminalize laws affecting LGBTIQ community in Sri Lanka. &#xa0;The LGBTIQ community continues to face discrimination and stigmatization in society. This leads to marginalization and exclusion them from mainstream activities. Political debate on decriminalization of same sex relations has now started in Sri Lanka following a private member motion tabled in parliament. Supreme Court has ruled decriminalization is not inconsistent with the constitution. &#xa0;Project aims at to ensure that decriminalizing same-sex relations is included in the election manifestos of all political parties in Sri Lanka in future national elections. In order to do that there is a need to raise awareness among youth and women activists within the main political parties. This project aims to address this problem by organizing a workshop series for political activists.</narrative>
  </description>
